  componentName: Position Verification Cylinder
  plcName: C+/C-
  plcAddress: 100.02
  description: "Model                         : CD85N12-50A\r\nType                          
    : Double-Acting Cylinder\r\nBore Diameter           : \xD812 mm\r\nStroke                       
    : 50 mm\r\nFlow Regulators        : Yes\rSolenoid Valve          : 5/2 Way Monostable\r\nPLC
    Output Address : 100.02\nPLC Signal (Extend)  : C+\r\nPLC Signal (Retract)  :
    C- (spring/de-energise)\r\n\nAdvances and inserts a cylindrical probe into the
    body housing to verify correct orientation. If the body is inverted, the probe
    cannot enter and the cylinder cannot complete its full stroke."
